{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/370e280acc9f1ea685fdf3d3bbf6334f34a93f7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y&gt;x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63c94025178119d4ef00385136a3a40c4ecc3aec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e60d14c5c9e10f7f7db6958319e1c9ae68d46ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } y&lt;x \\quad \\text{(B) } x&lt;y \\quad \\text{(C) } x&lt;y&lt;0 \\quad \\text{(D) } x&lt;0,y&lt;0 \\quad \\text{(E) } x&lt;0,y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"573\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/370e280acc9f1ea685fdf3d3bbf6334f34a93f7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y&gt;x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/2059cff04d6df1eba8a14b46380278b6b45fec2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-y&gt;0\\implies y&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />.\nFrom <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63c94025178119d4ef00385136a3a40c4ecc3aec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6ee81a7a535d87853e848c77654cc36104a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. \nSo, our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n<